        /// <br/>```
        /// <br/>https://myapp.com/auth/callback?authResult=%7B%22storedToken%22%3A%7B%22authDetails%22%3A%7B...%7D%2C%22cookieString%22%3A%22eyJ...%22%7D%7D
        /// <br/>```
        /// <br/>
